# General Practices
Use Functional Components: Ensure all components are functional, utilizing React hooks.
Use Turkish words on frontend, however you can use english for naming variables etc.

# Architecture
Component Structure: Organize files by feature with directories (e.g., dashboard, auth).
Use React for frontend.

# State Management
Use Zustand or Redux for global state management; leverage Context API for component-level state.

# Performance Optimization
Implement React.memo, useMemo, and useCallback for performance enhancements.

# Styling
Use Tailwind CSS for styling with utility-first approach. Ensure design is responsive.
Always use modern and simple user interface.
User experience is first focus.
Use basic colors to be eye-friendly.

# Routing
Utilize react-router-dom for managing navigation and dynamic routing.

# Error Handling
Apply validation using Zod; manage errors gracefully with user-friendly messages.

# Security
Sanitize user inputs to prevent XSS attacks.